usage: j3c golden <dir> [name...] [--bless]
  Runs each [[state]] of <dir>/golden.toml headless, captures target/golden/<name>.png and compares it
  with golden/<name>.png (PASS/FAIL per state; exit 1 on any FAIL). Names run only those states.
  --bless copies the captures over the goldens (only the named states, else all). [[check]] runs execute
  only without --bless. Format and recipe: `j3c doc testing`.
--- stderr
--- exit 2
